<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Low wages, CPI lessen rates pressure - Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Low wages, CPI lessen rates pressure - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Thursday low inflation and wages growth lessens the pressure on the interest rates.</p>
</text>
